{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-minor-running-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.74, step 7f. `scale-county-minor-running`: the PM species and the PAH particles at running and crankcase running exhaust (1, 15), and the metals and dioxins/furans at running exhaust, NOT aggregated -- for source types 21 and 62 on road type 4 alone, over the county database `inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`, at `<aggregateBy key=\"Hour\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Hour\"/>`: July 2020, weekdays, hour 8, with the VMT output on. It selects `scale-county-minor-offnet`'s 38 pollutants -- PM10 and PM2.5 totals, organic and elemental carbon, sulfate, NonECPM, aerosol water, nitrate, ammonium, the PM2.5 elements 51-59, PMOTHR, NCOM, TOM, the residual and the PAH particles -- at both processes, and the metals (60-63, 65-67) and dioxins/furans (130-146) at running exhaust, the only process MOVES associates them with. MOVESOutput is 11,704 rows, 154 per pollutant-process, and NO metal or dioxin row: the default database has no `sourceTypePolProcess` row for them, so SourceBinDistributionGenerator writes no source-bin distribution and BaseRateGenerator's distance-rate weighting (`SBWeightedDistanceRate`) is empty, with the VMT output on or off (`scale-county-metals-novmt`, 0 rows). Its off-network half is `scale-county-minor-offnet`; its Year twin `scale-county-timeagg-year-minor-running`.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES: `scale-county-minor-offnet`'s arithmetic at running exhaust and at the crankcase process whose parent is ON the network -- crankcase running's PM split from running exhaust's species -- and the metals' and dioxins' absence. Before PLAN.md §7.3.74 the model wrote none of the 13 new species, 16 particles or crankcase PM rows, and counted nothing.\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to 11704; `n_physicsRow` 21, the two source types' physics rows.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "running-exhaust",
      "crankcase",
      "pm-speciation",
      "air-toxics"
    ]
  },
